<KickoffSession
    documentTitle="Canada is the future of the planet. | Canada2080"
    description="Francis Wang on Canada as the future of the planet, and on hosting more of the world's people in a climate-changed 2080."
    eyebrow="Opening and close · 1:10 p.m. and 2:30 p.m."
    headline="Canada is the future of the planet."
    name="Francis Wang"
    bio="Francis Wang is the founder of Canada2080 and FW.VISION, and a dual doctoral researcher in AI and innovation. His work focuses on sovereign AI, distributed AI, strategic foresight, and resilient systems."
    profileUrl="https://www.linkedin.com/in/findcongwang/"
    podiumSrc="/images/events/2026-kickoff/gallery/img_5351.jpg"
    podiumAlt="Francis Wang speaking at the podium. The slide behind him reads bold ambition by 2080."
